  "title": "Slow Cooker Ropa Vieja",
  "description": "This slow cooker ropa vieja recipe is a Caribbean-style dish with beef in a seasoned tomato broth with peppers until fall-apart tender and flavorful.",
  "authors": [
    "abussone"
  ],
